{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_43","type":"agent_message","text":"Completed-GMT: 2026-09-24 20:18:38 GMT\nCompleted-Local: 2026-09-25 03:18:38 Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh\n\n**Architectural verdict:** No Phase 1 merge blocker found. The delta preserves the six foundational invariants. The canonical vector is a suitable Phase 2 lift target, with the deferred gates below completed before migration uses it.\n\n| Severity | File:line | Invariant/evidence | Recommended correction |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| P3 | [ucf.cljc:171](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-ucf/src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf.cljc:171) | A falsy operand such as `:gensym` prefix `false` executes with the loader’s default but is refused by canonicalization. This fails closed, though it overstates the documented equivalence law. | VM owner: match loader saturation or narrow the law before Phase 2. |\n| P3 | [ucf.cljc:77](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-ucf/src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf.cljc:77) | The absent FFI argc default is unreachable because batch validation requires argc. | VM owner: remove or annotate the entry. |\n| P3 | [ucf.cljc:265](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-ucf/src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf.cljc:265) | Static `:reasons` include design reasons that the current reference wait set does not mint. No Phase 1 consumer depends on them. | Phase 2 lift owner: align runtime reasons or name these as safepoint kinds. |\n| P3 | [ucf_test.cljc:607](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-ucf/test/yin/vm/ucf_test.cljc:607) | Several reason, retained-FFI, error-precedence, and nested-frame cases remain unpinned. | VM test owner: add them with the Phase 2 conformance harness. |\n| P3 | [ucf.cljc:81](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-ucf/src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf.cljc:81) | `index-batch` is a third identical private copy. | VM owner: consolidate at the next shared loader change. |\n| P3 | [implementer log](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/collab/1790243232166-vm-engineer-ucf-phase1.claude-sonnet-5.stdout.log) | The final implementation report is incomplete